  "articles": [
    {
      "sequence_id": 1,
      "text": "When clitic pronouns occur with infinitives or gerund forms (-ndo) they may either attach to the non-conjugated form or appear before the conjugated verb. For example: 'Voy a escribirlas' or 'Las voy a escribir' both mean 'I'm going to write them'."
    }
